*8 Help          │   2. Recognize a file
                 │      Pick a file, URL, or folder and recognize it. This fills
                 │      in AudD's example song.
                 │      $ audd recognize https://audd.tech/example.mp3
                 │ 
                 │   3. Listen
                 │      Record a few seconds from the microphone and identify
                 │      the song.
                 │      $ audd listen
                 │ 
                 │   4. Add a stream
 ctrl+k commands │      Have AudD monitor a radio or other live stream, then
 ? keys  q quit  │      watch it in Now playing.
